OL,3,ARussia launches missile strikes on Kyiv
OL,4,Aand surrounding region, killing at
OL,5,Aleast eight
OL,6,
OL,7,FA wave of overnight Russian missile
OL,8,Fstrikes has killed at least eight
OL,9,Fpeople in the capital Kyiv and the
OL,10,Fsurrounding region, Ukrainian
OL,11,Fauthorities say.
OL,13,FApartment blocks and warehouses were
OL,14,Fhit in the "massive attack" on
OL,15,FThursday, according to the State
OL,16,FEmergency Service of Ukraine (DSNS),
OL,17,Fwhile a children's hospital and school
OL,18,Fwere damaged. At least 33 people were
OL,19,Finjured.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
