OL,3,ARussia launches missile strikes on Kyiv
OL,4,Aand surrounding region, killing at
OL,5,Aleast eight
OL,6,
OL,7,FAuthorities are working to rescue
OL,8,Fpeople trapped underneath the rubble of
OL,9,Fdemolished buildings, with crews
OL,10,Falready pulling two survivors from
OL,11,Fdebris.
OL,13,FMeanwhile, Romania said one drone
OL,14,Fcrossed into its territory at the
OL,15,Fnorthern border with Ukraine triggering
OL,16,Fan air alert siren.
